<title>CHINA: Soccer-Results of China league games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of China league games.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 17th round matches of China's professional soccer league played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an     1   Guangzhou Apollo     0</p>
<p> Chinese Army	 2   Guangzhou Songri     0</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	1   Tianjin Samsung	0</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxin    1   Shenzhen		 0</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	 3   Guangdong Hongyuan   2</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua   1   Yanbian Hyundai	0</p>
</text>
